{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DHKlOmkjFY3YKMfhr0T6OA?scene=1&click_id=4","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.938269+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DHKlOmkjFY3YKMfhr0T6OA?scene=1&click_id=4","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/7kHBfiamdw2g0iafRp56bsmqaWtibRFJvcuYWoIt80V6Nz02KozrvX6W4D5dmV3MdDygZFHibxY6Gyyf454ShUBTow/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGs3nJibesPMTGBF8CdyeuZWhcoGcRLlw9khnq89SKoufY6SIqgE2IDsg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3bianORFYkPiaTwKQXZ4swnA0SE7jZQepsprJxmK54aib0sW0xXM1srxr5NJ7UPJps4rIId5g1Iza3YHQFXepOMYA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGhNOAoiaRnoNL3cHLj5sCvo2gqha6EyytYeWWGSINzpF6SJWgZlloJDQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEFVic6ibiagECwtVgI86zRVricpzCDowic0ZhTgwen9HOd0d4XTWbb9SU1A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>一、报考条件</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>1.拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>2.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>3.健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>4.一般应为“双一流”建设高校或“双一流”建设相关专业的2026年应届本科毕业生。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>5.鼓励交叉学科，工科、理科、生命科学或相关学科专业的优秀学生可积极报名。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>6.本科阶段综合素质优秀、学习成绩优秀，英语合格（CET6≥425或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0）。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>二、招生类别</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>多学科招生及支持交叉学科招生和培养是学院项目的重要特点之一。学院开展交叉学科研究，全面实施教育综合改革试点，致力于打破学习边界、学科边界、学校边界，探索构建具有世界影响、中国特色的育人体系，面向未来培养战略型、国际化科技领军人才。</p><p><strong>预推免主要面向工程硕博士改革专项及本科直博招生。</strong>各类别的推免选拔活动仅可参加其一，不可重复参加。夏令营已获得优营的考生，无需重复报名本次预推免。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>三、接收程序</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><p><strong><em>01</em></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b>网上报名</b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>报名方式：</strong></span><strong>考生登录上海交通大学推免考网报系统（http://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/ytmgl）报名。</strong></p><p><span><strong>报名时间：</strong></span><strong>即日起—9月14日上午9:00</strong></p><p>①报考本科直博生者需提前联系好导师，经导师同意后方可报名。预推免招收直博生状态详见：https://pan.sjtu.edu.cn/web/share/90ce12004bacf3b675525ef7164467d2。</p><p>②意向报考工程硕博士专项的同学，于9月14日上午9:00前填写志愿登记问卷（链接：https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PpD5qaz.aspx#），并同步在上海交通大学推免网报系统中提交系统报名（即问卷登记+推免系统网报）。</p><p>③参加过我院暑期优才夏令营的考生无需报考，如报考，则代表放弃夏令营考核结果及优惠政策。</p><p>④生源高校推免名额暂未确定的同学，仍可报名，待入围复试后可补交推免资格证明；如最终未能获得生源学校推免资格，我校将不予录取。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><p><strong><em>02</em></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b>初审</b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>学院根据申请者的报名信息以及学院的招生计划，确定初审通过者。初审通过者可参加之后的复试环节。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><p><strong><em>03</em></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b>复试安排</b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>复试方式为面试选拔，复试时间预计在9月16日进行，结果通知预计在9月18日发布，具体时间和地点会以邮件形式另行通知。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><p><strong><em>04</em></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>优惠政策</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>在预推免活动中表现优秀的同学将获得“优秀营员”激励政策。优秀营员若获得所在学校免试推荐直升研究生资格，并在教育部推免系统中填报我院，我院将按照预推免综合考核成绩，并依据各专项或导师所分配的招生名额，从高分到低分依次拟录取，额满为止。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>四、</strong><strong>申请材料</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>请考生自行准备以下<strong>电子版和纸质版</strong>材料，电子版材料（PDF文件）需上传报名系统，纸质版材料需在面试当天递交给面试组的秘书。</p><p>1、申请表（无需上传系统，完成系统报名后下载打印，仅提交纸质版）；</p><p>2、个人简历；</p><p>3、学籍认证报告（从学信网www.chsi.com.cn上在线验证并下载）；</p><p>4、本科成绩单1份（加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院本科生教务办的公章，电子版需彩印）；</p><p>5、专业成绩排名证明1份（加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院本科生教务办的公章）；</p><p>6、英语成绩单（CET6、TOEFL、IELTS）原件的复印件，或彩打官方出具的电子版成绩单；</p><p>7、主要的获奖证书复印件；</p><p>8、学术科研成果（论文、专利）。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>五、学费</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>根据财政部、教育部的相关文件精神，我校按照全国研究生招生计划招收的全部研究生均需缴纳学费。具体收费标准请查阅上海交通大学信息公开网https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Data/View/4706。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>六、注意事项</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>1.申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。对在推免过程中弄虚作假，有论文抄袭、虚报获奖或科研成果等学术不端行为或者有其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的学生，一经查实，取消推免资格，已入学的，取消学籍，并由推荐高校所在地的省级教育招生考试机构按规定记入《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>2.其他相关要求按《上海交通大学2026年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）办法》执行。</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGEwfebncrQyVWTsPlKsPMMYNmuBhI01hmibfiblUX1qibbtvuM6ysDfzXg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGKYxBMWsibiazVj9dOwkIhXR3poTLabovV3UxsMUMOMGqyEicujfyodScw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>七、联系方式</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gmK6tTxI8dVZXiaxefrv5D2d9lST9F5ibGicIEvzqpX6pqkN4Rehz9u9qD5hYYr4r7w4HLAN6gwsj7EzIWzFxhIWg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>联系人：杨老师</p><p>电话：021-54741175-1506</p><p>联系邮箱:</p><p>gift.admission@sjtu.edu.cn</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/yeXgiaqCFwuPiboiaxhkribbR80DCTVwppzwnlJia7l9rnPYAFOaNgJLD9rQW1MXEoAFV4TvugcKYW1u4NOU3pthsrw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p>-END-</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/7kHBfiamdw2g0iafRp56bsmqaWtibRFJvcugTfMbI1vN8ibgY8fYk8TDVr2m96PF3ULXnSE5WsCJETQSnFicibkBrMPQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6f3448c2b6395583a809814407c5d50ba54ce288bfeed525df9ae473db11535c","textLength":1756,"sourceSha256":"67b407f4b4e736e30e3eac93f7230f733e0e9eeac39929c563c39cef6d2bfadc","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d4ac60d7f87a5d6f2009","title":"2025年上海交通大学溥渊未来技术学院2026年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预推免办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.938269+00:00"}
